controls.tooltip:
Paint · sculpt.vmapPaint · {chord}
Raises the selected weight map toward 100 %.
Ctrl: lower toward 0 · Shift: smooth

Smooth · sculpt.vmapSmooth · {chord}
Blurs the selected weight map's values.
Ctrl: sharpen · Shift: smooth

Scale Down · sculpt.vmapScale · {chord}
Pulls the selected weight map's values toward 0.
Ctrl: scale up · Shift: smooth

Erase · sculpt.vmapErase · {chord}
Removes the selected weight map's values.
Ctrl: erase · Shift: smooth

Set Value · sculpt.vmapSetVal · {chord}
Writes exactly Value into the selected weight map.
Ctrl: erase · Shift: smooth
